/-!
# Bit planes of the adapted Mathieu matrices

Each pair stores the coefficients of 1 and omega separately. These are
candidate rows, regenerated from the original JSON by `source/pack.py`.
`Checks` certifies their agreement with the published interleaved digits,
the inverse identity, and the action of the actual Schreier generators.
The originals and ATLAS attribution remain in `NaturalFiltration/source/README.md`.
-/

